msgid "Sign up on chat.fhir.org community and follow the stream who-smart-guidelines for questions, queries and chats related to WHO SMART Guidelines chat.fhir.org WHO also hosts weekly calls on authoring and implementing WHO SMART Guidelines where participation is welcome. Please send an email at gdhcn-support@who.int in order to get invited. gdhcn-support@who.int"
msgstr "请在 chat.fhir.org 社区注册，并关注 who-smart-guidelines 频道，以提出与世卫组织 SMART 指南相关的问题、咨询和讨论。chat.fhir.org WHO 还每周举办关于编写和实施世卫组织（WHO）SMART 指南的电话会议，欢迎参加。如需获得邀请，请发送电子邮件至 gdhcn-support@who.int。gdhcn-support@who.int"

